  <name>PeerTube2Nostr</name>
  <summary>Publish PeerTube channel videos to Nostr</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      PeerTube2Nostr ingests videos from PeerTube channels using the PeerTube API
      as the primary source, with RSS/Atom as a fallback. It then publishes a
      Nostr note per video with proper attribution and playback links.
    </p>
